{"suttaId":"thag5.6","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1590,1605],"vripara":"340"},"segments":{"thag5.6:0.4":"Nadīkassapattheragāthā","thag5.6:1.1":"“Atthāya vata me buddho, nadiṃ nerañjaraṃ agā;","thag5.6:1.3":"Yassāhaṃ dhammaṃ sutvāna, micchādiṭṭhiṃ vivajjayiṃ.","thag5.6:2.1":"“Yajiṃ uccāvace yaññe, aggihuttaṃ juhiṃ ahaṃ;","thag5.6:2.3":"‘Esā suddhī’ti maññanto, andhabhūto [andhībhūto (ka.)] puthujjano.","thag5.6:3.1":"“Diṭṭhigahanapakkhando [pakkhanto (sī.), pakkhanno (syā. pī.)], parāmāsena mohito;","thag5.6:3.3":"Asuddhiṃ maññisaṃ suddhiṃ, andhabhūto aviddasu.","thag5.6:4.1":"“Micchādiṭṭhi pahīnā me, bhavā sabbe padālitā [vidālitā (ka.)];","thag5.6:4.3":"Juhāmi dakkhiṇeyyaggiṃ, namassāmi tathāgataṃ.","thag5.6:5.1":"“Mohā sabbe pahīnā me, bhavataṇhā padālitā;","thag5.6:5.3":"Vikkhīṇo jātisaṃsāro, natthi dāni punabbhavo”ti.","thag5.6:5.5":"… Nadīkassapo thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
